WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.083 --> 00:00:02.292
(Record scratch)

00:00:02.292 --> 00:00:09.083
(Music starts)

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:13.209
I don't see a problem

00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:14.626
I'll draw you a map,

00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:17.000
meet you when I can.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.667
I gotta follow my own path,

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.876
and welcome what finds me

00:00:22.876 --> 00:00:24.792
right where I am.

00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:29.792
And if you're gonna love me tomorrow,

00:00:29.792 --> 00:00:34.125
maybe you could love me today.

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:38.083
The love songs and poetry you borrow,

00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:42.417
picks me up, carries me away.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:45.250
But I'd like to look farther

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:50.292
than the sun on Saturday.

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:52.709
And if I hold on tight,

00:00:52.709 --> 00:00:57.667
I might not fall and float away.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:05.292
I don't wanna lose my place.

00:01:05.292 --> 00:01:08.042
I'm catching a break now.

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:13.417
I'm chipping away at the brightest gold.

00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:17.459
I gotta see it for myself,

00:01:17.459 --> 00:01:22.125
and let it become a sight to behold.

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:26.042
And if you're gonna love me tomorrow,

00:01:26.042 --> 00:01:30.375
maybe you could love me today.

00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:34.709
You get lost in the pretty afterglow,

00:01:34.709 --> 00:01:38.751
picks you up, carries you away.

00:01:38.751 --> 00:01:46.501
I'm not looking for a big distraction anyway.

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:49.250
I'll climb up to the top

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:54.042
and yell out all I have to say.

00:01:54.042 --> 00:02:02.125
Why can't that start today?

00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:07.501
(Music)

00:02:07.501 --> 00:02:12.626
You're gonna love me, yeah!

00:02:12.626 --> 00:02:15.459
(Music)

00:02:15.459 --> 00:02:21.292
You're gonna love me, yeah!

00:02:21.292 --> 00:02:24.375
'Cause I'm catching a break now.

00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:26.000
(Music)

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.375
I'm catching a break now.

00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:35.375
(Music)

00:02:35.375 --> 00:02:40.083
(Music ends)

